comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T19:08:18.893Z",codex-agent,"Audit scope: configureLocalOllamaSearch -> SDK readSettings/writeSettings snapshot delta protocol; doctor and projectExists -> SDK assertInitializedTracker with explicit tracker roots. Related SDK-adoption items: pm-web-8pml and pm-web-cvny. Keep pinned SDK 2026.10.20; no telemetry edits. Neither replaced path previously verified item history; retain existing verified item reads and add a cache-primed corruption regression. Differential and behavioral revert proofs will use disposable non-git trackers."
  "2026-10-25T19:16:09.482Z",codex-agent,"Revert proofs: settings body alone restored from baseline: node --test --test-name-pattern=^Ollama test/sdk-adoption.test.ts fails 4/4 (audit, SDK lock wait, primed-cache corruption detection, invalid settings refusal). projectExists alone restored: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^SDK preflight\" test/sdk-adoption.test.ts fails 1/1 on a searchable but unreadable root. Baseline doctor restored and rebuilt: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"^web doctor\" test/sdk-adoption.test.ts fails 1/1 on a tasks-only root. Candidate restored and rebuilt; seven adoption regressions pass. Test-only fixture seeding uses audited SDK writes; no production history is rewritten. Intentional stricter behavior and reproducible differential runner are in docs/sdk-adoption-2026-10-25.md."
  "2026-10-25T19:17:51.265Z",codex-agent,"Differential proof passed on three real public tracker snapshots: pm-web, pm-slack and pm-vcs. Baseline build 74ee868 versus candidate: parsed settings values and initialized/present/missing project outputs identical. Assertions enumerate four intended SDK differences: tasks-only roots refused; searchable but unreadable roots refused; schema-invalid settings refused; one verified settings audit entry appended. No source tracker was written. Typecheck (server/frontend/tests), lint, duplication (0 percent), and docstring gates pass. Removed local settings persistence/merge and marker algorithms; SDK pin and coverage thresholds unchanged."
  "2026-10-25T19:28:58.264Z",codex-agent,"PR #261 is ready for review at 81c89aa. Final rebuilt differential proof again passes on pm-web, pm-slack and pm-vcs snapshots with all documented differences asserted. pm-linked targeted suite passed 32/32. Strict tracker health passes with the repository CI-pinned GitHub extension installed. Initial local isolated npm full coverage has reproduced the existing pm-web-qdhx catalog timing class: built Presets acceptance exceeded its unchanged 300000 ms deadline (300008.812 ms), followed by a source scenario failure. Preserve failed evidence; full counters and diagnostics are pending. Independent Bun gate and CI Node 22/26 full gates are running. No deadline or coverage threshold is changed."
  "2026-10-25T20:17:42.639Z",codex-agent,"All audit findings adopted: two findings across three sites, none deferred and no missing SDK API blocker. Deleted 68 lines from existing production source; shared SDK preflight adds 12 lines. Final differential against baseline 74ee868 passes on pm-web, pm-slack and pm-vcs non-git public tracker snapshots, with all four intentional SDK differences asserted. Revert proofs remain 4 settings regressions, 1 project preflight and 1 built doctor regression failing with only each replacement reverted. pm-linked targeted command passed 32/32; typecheck, test typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and strict tracker health pass.\n\nFull evidence on implementation 81c89aa: CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/actions/runs/40225837893 passes on Node 22 and 26; npm and Bun each pass 843/843 in both jobs. Each gate includes capacity 2/2, packed consumers 4/4, production audit and release metadata checks. All 63 configured server files meet unchanged thresholds; tracker-preflight is 100 in every dimension. CodeQL passes.\n\nBoth local isolated-identity release gates pass: env HOME=\"$(mktemp -d)\" GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check and equivalent bun run release:check. npm coverage S/L 93.39, B 84.38, F 97.26; Bun S/L 93.39, B 84.41, F 97.26. Each local gate: 843/843 functional, capacity 2/2, packed 4/4, zero production audit vulnerabilities. Initial npm failure remains recorded (841 pass, 1 fail, 1 canceled) with existing timing follow-up pm-web-qdhx; unchanged retry passes. An initial isolated Bun run was invalidated for missing base-ref setup, corrected before the full passing retry. SDK read fallback warnings are explicitly refused before settings persistence; no new upstream API defect remains. PR #261 remains ready for review; no merge, release or hosted change. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification; item stays unclosed. Final receipt changes only tracker/documentation, with implementation unchanged."
